## 4. Custom Authentication & Development Interceptor
Configured in [Program.cs](file:///C:/Users/farha/OneDrive/Desktop/CogStay--20-07/CogStay---Project2/Program.cs):
* **Custom Cookie Authentication**: Implemented role claim mapping via standard ASP.NET Core cookies.
* **Simulator Auto-Login Interceptor**: Added custom middleware events during unauthorized redirects. If the query string contains `?role=Admin`, `?role=FrontDesk`, etc. (or within the `ReturnUrl`), the system automatically registers a mock authenticated user session for that role. This enables seamless navigation in development simulation previews without forcing constant login inputs.

